  Precision/recall are reported ONLY with coverage: a corpus can look perfect on the
  cases it decided while shrugging on the rest. An n/a rate means a 0 denominator —
  it is NOT a 1.00. UNVERIFIED and unadjudicated labels are excluded, never a PASS.

